<title>USA: City Hotels seeks to invest $100 mln in 97.</title>
<headline>City Hotels seeks to invest $100 mln in 97.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>City Hotels USA said Thursday it plans to invest in excess of $100 million in hotel acquisitions in 1997.</p>
<p>The company said it owns 10 hotels and has two additional properties under construction.</p>
